    "long_instructions": "## Driving Chatbot Version 2\r\n\r\nHere is an updated version of the chatbot. Test out some of the same questions from before and notice how the responses are different.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) **Investigate:** Test the chatbot with at least 4 different messages. You can use the same ones as before.\r\n2) **Discuss:** How are the responses different? How do you think the new system prompt is updating the responses?\r\n\r\nOnce you're finished, press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Continue</code> button!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n::: details [**Click here to see example messages to try in this level**]\r\n* What are the requirements to get a driving permit?\r\n* What happens if you run a red light?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
